WEBVTT

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
"Descent"

01:40.160 --> 01:41.150
Defend him!

01:41.700 --> 01:43.750
Even if it costs us our lives...

01:44.330 --> 01:46.210
...we must let Eren reach the gate!

01:46.830 --> 01:50.030
Do not let the Titans get near him!

01:51.500 --> 01:54.690
They're going to plug the hole
with that? It's insane...

01:55.130 --> 01:57.299
Eren might end up getting eaten.

01:57.300 --> 02:00.270
And if that happens,
we still won't know a thing.

02:00.640 --> 02:05.060
Yeah... If it comes to it, I'll have to do
something with my Titan somehow.

02:05.430 --> 02:09.939
But if their plan works, it'll plug
the hole we finally opened.

02:09.940 --> 02:11.649
It doesn't matter.

02:11.650 --> 02:16.319
We've been searching for a clue these
past five years and we finally found it.

02:16.320 --> 02:18.200
Hey... you guys?

02:18.900 --> 02:21.990
What... were you just talking about?

02:26.500 --> 02:28.890
What did you mean by "my Titan," Reiner?

02:29.330 --> 02:32.540
What's this about "The hole
we opened," Bertholdt?

02:36.210 --> 02:37.260
Marco...

02:39.590 --> 02:42.630
That conversation just now... was a joke.

02:44.890 --> 02:48.559
H-Have you guys lost it?
This isn't like you!

02:48.560 --> 02:50.389
Focus on the mission!

02:50.390 --> 02:52.920
Look, the Titans are coming! Let's go!

03:02.320 --> 03:04.810
Eren transformed into a Titan...

03:05.740 --> 03:07.670
Humans can become Titans...

03:08.790 --> 03:13.150
So if the Colossal Titan appeared out
of nowhere and suddenly vanished...

03:13.790 --> 03:15.850
...it's probably a human, too.

03:17.840 --> 03:22.160
In other words, the enemy Titans
are hiding as humans somewhere.

03:22.680 --> 03:23.650
That means...

03:27.820 --> 03:28.560
Reiner!

03:28.561 --> 03:31.230
R-Reiner! What are you doing?!

03:31.940 --> 03:33.000
Reiner?!

03:34.230 --> 03:36.069
This is a joke, right?!

03:36.070 --> 03:40.610
No, Marco... The problem
is you're too damn sharp.

03:41.860 --> 03:43.570
Someone help...!

03:48.330 --> 03:50.080
Annie! Help me out!

03:51.160 --> 03:53.039
What's this all about?

03:53.040 --> 03:56.039
Reiner's acting crazy! Help me!

03:56.040 --> 03:57.670
He heard our conversation.

03:58.120 --> 03:59.760
We can't let him live.

04:02.220 --> 04:04.470
You're shitting me... You asshole!

04:05.050 --> 04:05.730
What?

04:08.010 --> 04:10.570
A Titan! It's coming this way!

04:12.350 --> 04:15.180
Annie! Take off Marco's ODM gear!

04:15.730 --> 04:16.270
Huh?!

04:18.020 --> 04:19.220
Do it, fast!

04:19.610 --> 04:21.430
Why... do I have to?

04:23.200 --> 04:26.980
Back there, you risked your
life for Conny, didn't you?

04:27.620 --> 04:29.870
Why did you put yourself in danger?

04:30.740 --> 04:33.950
Have you become attached to
this evil race or something?

04:34.290 --> 04:37.190
If I'm wrong, prove it to me right now!

04:37.670 --> 04:41.169
If you, and your father waiting
for you to come home,

04:41.170 --> 04:45.259
are any different than this
filthy race, prove it right now!

04:45.260 --> 04:47.590
Reiner! It's almost on top of us!

04:47.720 --> 04:48.650
Annie!

04:53.810 --> 04:56.809
Stop it! Annie! Don't do this!

04:56.810 --> 05:00.020
Why?! Why?! Why?! Why do this?!

05:00.360 --> 05:01.590
Annie!

05:04.150 --> 05:06.199
This is what makes us warriors.

05:06.200 --> 05:08.290
Annie, you did well.

05:10.450 --> 05:12.699
Reiner. What now?

05:12.700 --> 05:15.320
Not yet. We have to let them gather first.

05:15.750 --> 05:20.150
I see... They were waiting
for all the Titans to gather...

05:25.130 --> 05:26.590
Wait...

05:27.130 --> 05:31.580
Why? What are you in such a hurry for?!

05:33.680 --> 05:36.060
We haven't... even...

05:37.140 --> 05:41.980
...had a chance to talk this through!

05:58.620 --> 05:59.250
Hey...

05:59.670 --> 06:00.500
Why...

06:06.590 --> 06:07.620
...is Marco...

06:09.050 --> 06:10.310
...getting eaten?

06:15.980 --> 06:17.310
I already told you...

06:17.890 --> 06:20.230
Annie is doing fine, I'm sure.

06:20.690 --> 06:22.940
There's no way she's getting tortured.

06:23.730 --> 06:26.520
For starters, don't you
think that's unlikely?

06:26.940 --> 06:32.230
With powers like ours, one scratch and
we can pretty much handle anything.

06:32.740 --> 06:35.699
And remember it's Annie
we're talking about here.

06:35.700 --> 06:40.080
I bet she's in hiding somewhere
practicing her kicks and what not.

06:40.290 --> 06:43.999
Still, there's no mistaking
her identity was revealed.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.430
Even if it's Annie...

06:45.840 --> 06:49.390
Oh? Does this mean you're
not fully committed yet?

06:50.380 --> 06:51.799
Is that right?

06:51.800 --> 06:56.350
And what about the agreement
we came to? Was that all for nothing?

06:58.270 --> 07:01.060
We can go at it again if you want, Reiner.

07:01.520 --> 07:06.360
But the next time you lose, you give up
your armor to another warrior.

07:06.570 --> 07:08.890
N-No, that's not what I meant.

07:09.650 --> 07:11.340
Then pull yourself together.

07:11.820 --> 07:13.360
We only have one goal.

07:14.160 --> 07:18.620
To recover the Coordinate and
put an end to this cursed history.

07:20.870 --> 07:22.920
Let's... end this.

07:25.460 --> 07:28.420
I want to end all this, with us.

07:30.420 --> 07:34.930
Understood. I'll try to keep
Annie out of my head for now.

07:35.300 --> 07:38.680
There's no need to put anyone
else through this hell but us.

07:40.810 --> 07:41.690
Let's...

07:45.860 --> 07:47.160
...end this.

07:49.070 --> 07:50.320
Bertholdt...

07:53.780 --> 07:55.120
War Chief Zeke.

07:57.830 --> 07:59.700
Enemy troops are approaching.

08:00.330 --> 08:01.910
They've reached the foot.

08:06.290 --> 08:08.170
My brave warriors.

08:08.670 --> 08:13.080
It's time to settle this here and
finish our mission once and for all.

08:16.430 --> 08:17.110
Hot!

08:24.020 --> 08:24.730
...Let's go.

08:24.730 --> 08:25.350
...Yeah.
...Let's go.

08:30.190 --> 08:30.990
Bertholdt.

08:31.490 --> 08:33.699
I've told you a bunch of times, but...

08:33.700 --> 08:35.810
You and I will be in separate positions.

08:36.450 --> 08:38.869
So try thinking on your own for once.

08:38.870 --> 08:40.370
R-Right.

08:41.080 --> 08:43.619
You don't always have
to wait for my signal.

08:43.620 --> 08:45.710
Yeah, I know.

08:46.250 --> 08:49.799
You're supposed to be the one
with the greatest ability of all,

08:49.800 --> 08:51.950
yet you leave it to others when it matters.

08:52.800 --> 08:55.460
To be honest, I never thought you reliable.

08:56.430 --> 08:57.640
I know.

08:58.350 --> 08:59.740
Up until now.

09:02.270 --> 09:04.270
We're ending this here, right?

09:05.730 --> 09:06.670
That's right.

09:07.270 --> 09:09.270
We're gonna win and end this.

09:11.940 --> 09:15.149
Keep up that attitude till
you're with your beloved Annie.

09:15.150 --> 09:17.529
I-It's not like that...

09:17.530 --> 09:22.239
I bet even Annie would appreciate
the one who rushes in to save her...

09:22.240 --> 09:24.410
...and mistake him for her prince.

09:24.910 --> 09:26.920
Even if it's you.

09:27.620 --> 09:29.720
And... Christa...

09:30.590 --> 09:32.420
We'll save her no matter what.

09:32.880 --> 09:34.670
That's our promise to Ymir.

09:35.130 --> 09:37.120
Yeah, no matter what.

09:39.600 --> 09:42.349
See ya. I'm counting on you, buddy.

09:42.350 --> 09:43.450
Leave it to me.

09:54.320 --> 09:56.830
It's been a while since
Reiner transformed...

09:57.860 --> 09:59.449
No signal yet?

09:59.450 --> 10:02.680
Reiner... Are you okay out there?

10:04.080 --> 10:05.830
We did it!

10:06.370 --> 10:08.289
We blew his head off!

10:08.290 --> 10:10.460
The Armored Titan bit the dust!

10:14.130 --> 10:15.010
We did it...

10:15.590 --> 10:18.380
You were such a pain in the ass for us.

10:18.720 --> 10:20.850
Serves you right, scumbag!

10:29.140 --> 10:31.059
What the hell are you crying for?!

10:31.060 --> 10:34.230
C'mon, get up! This ain't over yet!

10:35.940 --> 10:38.320
Don't cry! We're the ones who killed him!

10:43.080 --> 10:46.710
It's not over! Ready your equipment
for the next round!

10:51.960 --> 10:52.730
Armin...

10:53.460 --> 10:56.750
It's not like... we had
any chance to negotiate...

10:58.340 --> 11:02.590
It's our side dealing with the
overwhelming lack of information.

11:03.680 --> 11:07.930
We don't have the power to capture
someone who can turn into a Titan.

11:08.680 --> 11:11.530
There was... nothing we could do.

11:30.210 --> 11:31.020
It can't be...

11:35.750 --> 11:37.820
There it was! The signal!

11:46.010 --> 11:50.110
Nail him with Thunder Spears!
We'll just have to blow his body to bits!

11:51.390 --> 11:53.120
That scream just now...

11:53.850 --> 11:55.340
Was it for Bertholdt?

11:59.400 --> 12:02.779
Wait! We need to get away from Reiner!

12:02.780 --> 12:05.070
Up there! The Colossal Titan is coming!

12:05.490 --> 12:07.150
We'll all get blown away!

12:08.330 --> 12:10.949
Where are you, Reiner?! I'm coming!

12:17.290 --> 12:18.050
Tsk!

12:21.550 --> 12:22.640
They got us...

12:23.090 --> 12:25.970
Shit! Everyone, get away
from the Armored Titan!

12:26.300 --> 12:28.930
The Colossal Titan is falling our way!

12:32.560 --> 12:34.770
Shoot! At this distance...

12:36.270 --> 12:38.020
...none of us can avoid it.

12:41.740 --> 12:43.060
I'm close to the ground.

12:43.530 --> 12:46.320
It's now or never. I'll blow
this whole place away.

12:58.880 --> 13:01.550
Reiner!

13:06.260 --> 13:07.010
Reiner?!

13:09.600 --> 13:10.800
Reiner?

13:16.770 --> 13:17.660
He's alive!

13:18.060 --> 13:18.980
But he...

13:20.400 --> 13:24.270
He transferred his consciousness
throughout his whole nervous system?

13:25.490 --> 13:28.360
But that was... a last resort.

13:29.070 --> 13:31.050
To think he'd actually do it...

13:32.870 --> 13:35.550
It's hard to believe they
cornered you like that.

13:36.960 --> 13:37.930
Reiner...

13:41.130 --> 13:42.990
I need you to do something for me.

13:43.960 --> 13:46.160
You're going to have to move a little.

13:47.590 --> 13:50.259
And if you can't, I'm sorry...

13:50.260 --> 13:51.690
Prepare for the worst.

13:57.730 --> 13:58.940
I'm ending this.

14:02.690 --> 14:07.239
In any case, our mission objective
just came falling into our laps.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.950
You could even call this lucky.

14:09.990 --> 14:11.950
Target approaching from ahead!

14:12.410 --> 14:13.450
It's Bertholdt!

14:14.540 --> 14:16.210
Our plan is as follows:

14:16.410 --> 14:19.629
Levi Squad protects Eren
under Armin's command!

14:19.630 --> 14:22.919
All others work together to
take down the two targets!

14:22.920 --> 14:23.580
Roger!

14:26.420 --> 14:27.380
Please wait!

14:27.930 --> 14:29.089
Armin?

14:29.090 --> 14:31.450
This is our final chance to negotiate!

14:37.390 --> 14:39.950
Bertholdt! Stop right there!

14:44.440 --> 14:45.310
Armin...

14:46.110 --> 14:48.310
What are you trying to accomplish?

14:50.610 --> 14:53.530
Bertholdt! Let's talk this over!

14:58.250 --> 15:02.080
If I agree to talk, would
you all agree to die?!

15:03.460 --> 15:05.750
We only want two simple things!

15:06.260 --> 15:09.680
We want Eren and the demise
of humanity in the walls!

15:10.340 --> 15:13.960
That's the harsh truth of reality, Armin!

15:14.680 --> 15:17.020
It's all been decided already!

15:17.180 --> 15:21.200
Wha...? Wh-Who decided any of that?!

15:22.150 --> 15:23.020
I did...

15:23.310 --> 15:24.150
Huh?

15:24.820 --> 15:25.770
What was that?!

15:26.190 --> 15:27.739
I decided it!

15:27.740 --> 15:30.150
Your lives are coming to an end right here!

15:32.200 --> 15:34.120
That's very unfortunate!

15:34.410 --> 15:38.500
I was hoping... I wouldn't have to
hear Annie's screams any longer!

15:40.460 --> 15:44.209
The only one who can save her from
the savages in the Military Police...

15:44.210 --> 15:46.499
...is you, and no one else!

15:46.500 --> 15:48.799
At this rate, she'll end up
as feed for the pigs!

15:48.800 --> 15:49.720
Fine by me!

15:49.920 --> 15:50.470
Huh?

15:51.970 --> 15:53.889
Let 'em feed her to the pigs!

15:53.890 --> 15:56.450
If they really have her, that is!

15:57.260 --> 16:00.230
What's the rush, Armin?
Aren't we going to talk?

16:04.520 --> 16:08.640
Did you think that if you talked
about Annie, I'd lose my cool again?

16:09.070 --> 16:11.619
That since I'm the meek
and timid Bertholdt,

16:11.620 --> 16:13.660
you could fool me into
letting my guard down?

16:16.830 --> 16:19.040
Stand down, Eren. You should know.

16:19.790 --> 16:21.990
You've got a slim chance against him.

16:22.620 --> 16:24.290
This isn't your fight yet.

16:24.920 --> 16:27.750
Shit... Armin, why?!

16:28.590 --> 16:31.970
I know what you're doing.
You're just buying time.

16:32.720 --> 16:34.840
Surrounding me with soldiers...

16:35.220 --> 16:38.720
...and distracting me with this ruse
while the others finish off Reiner!

16:39.390 --> 16:40.889
I can tell.

16:40.890 --> 16:44.770
You're standing there shaking
so much, you can't do a damn thing.

16:46.230 --> 16:49.530
If you knew that much,
why did you even come talk?

16:51.780 --> 16:53.280
I wanted to know.

16:54.240 --> 16:56.242
To know whether,
if I faced you guys,

16:56.267 --> 17:00.604
I'd start whining and beg
for forgiveness again.

17:01.950 --> 17:02.660
But...

17:04.500 --> 17:06.280
...seems like I'm fine now.

17:07.210 --> 17:12.130
Yeah. You are precious comrades to me.
I also intend to kill you.

17:13.510 --> 17:17.920
Is that... because you think
we're spawn of the devil?

17:18.350 --> 17:19.170
No.

17:19.510 --> 17:23.200
None of you have done anything wrong,
and you're not devils either.

17:23.770 --> 17:26.280
But you all still have to die.

17:26.850 --> 17:28.170
That's just how it is.

17:34.820 --> 17:35.950
Mikasa!

17:43.200 --> 17:45.410
Armin! Don't chase!

17:46.000 --> 17:48.330
There's no knowing when he'll transform.

17:48.630 --> 17:52.200
If we don't keep our distance,
we'll get caught in another explosion.

17:52.670 --> 17:55.240
I don't think Bertholdt
intends to just yet.

17:55.590 --> 18:00.310
Reiner's on the verge of death,
so if he did, he'd finish Reiner off.

18:01.010 --> 18:04.780
We could take Reiner as a hostage
and fight him straight on with swords.

18:05.230 --> 18:07.230
We should, but...

18:07.810 --> 18:11.060
It seemed like he had
some sort of plan though.

18:12.480 --> 18:15.530
Still, was that really Bertholdt just now?

18:16.450 --> 18:19.020
To me, he seemed like a different person.

18:20.280 --> 18:21.190
Me, too.

18:23.080 --> 18:25.579
Hurry! The Armored Titan is weak!

18:25.580 --> 18:26.730
Let's finish him off!

18:27.920 --> 18:28.600
Wha...?

18:29.540 --> 18:31.190
He's facing upwards now?!

18:32.500 --> 18:34.050
We can't finish him off!

18:35.630 --> 18:37.490
This is a very strange feeling...

18:38.010 --> 18:39.990
I don't feel that scared at all.

18:40.430 --> 18:42.230
I can see everything clearly.

18:42.850 --> 18:47.400
I feel like, no matter how this all
plays out, I can accept whatever happens.

18:48.390 --> 18:50.680
That's right, nobody's in the wrong.

18:51.310 --> 18:52.560
There's nothing we could do.

18:55.190 --> 18:56.320
Because this world...

18:57.900 --> 18:58.960
...is just...

18:59.740 --> 19:01.120
...that cruel.

19:01.570 --> 19:03.489
He's going up! Don't tell me...

19:03.490 --> 19:06.119
But I thought Reiner was right over there!

19:06.120 --> 19:07.330
Quick, get out of here!

19:09.580 --> 19:10.520
Hange!

19:44.330 --> 19:45.520
You guys alive?!

19:45.740 --> 19:48.119
I don't know! Are you?!

19:48.120 --> 19:50.500
I-I'm hanging in there...

19:51.290 --> 19:52.580
Mikasa! Armin!

19:53.750 --> 19:54.450
You okay?!

19:54.790 --> 19:55.650
We're fine.

19:56.170 --> 19:57.000
Hange Squad?

19:58.710 --> 20:00.760
They were so close to Bertholdt...

20:14.810 --> 20:15.900
You don't think...

20:22.070 --> 20:23.450
...the only ones who survived...

20:24.410 --> 20:25.700
...are us here?

20:34.790 --> 20:36.130
H-Hey...

20:42.590 --> 20:43.880
Armin! What now?!

20:44.340 --> 20:46.550
Wait for burning houses to flatten us?!

20:47.600 --> 20:48.460
Armin.

20:48.890 --> 20:51.770
You're in command. We follow your orders.

20:54.480 --> 20:55.850
We retreat...

20:56.360 --> 20:58.630
Rally at the commander for new orders.

20:59.400 --> 21:04.029
We'll engage the Colossal Titan in a
battle of attrition as originally planned.

21:04.030 --> 21:05.489
Hold up, Armin...

21:05.490 --> 21:05.950
Huh?

21:06.740 --> 21:09.850
It'll be a disaster if we let Bertholdt
near the wall and the others.

21:11.450 --> 21:13.829
If the houses in the inner gate catch fire,

21:13.830 --> 21:16.970
they'll be sandwiched between
the fire and the Beast Titan.

21:17.380 --> 21:18.960
Th-That means...

21:19.550 --> 21:22.060
...we have no choice but to
defeat Bertholdt right here?

21:22.590 --> 21:26.260
And we have to do it...
with the people we have here?

21:33.020 --> 21:34.309
A-Armin!

21:34.310 --> 21:35.979
The fire! Your orders?!

21:35.980 --> 21:37.100
Hurry it up!

21:53.950 --> 21:55.370
What will you do?

21:56.500 --> 21:57.700
Beast Titan...

21:58.750 --> 22:00.960
Is this exactly what you wanted?

23:41.190 --> 23:45.550
With the Colossal Titan's arrival,
Shiganshina becomes a blaze.

23:46.360 --> 23:50.990
Meanwhile, Erwin and the others take
a serious blow from the Beast Titan.

23:52.180 --> 23:54.239
Next episode: "Perfect Game."

23:54.240 --> 23:56.539
"Perfect Game"
